"Nilama Paragon Academy is an expensive private school for Avowed children in the Nilama area."
"It has a primary building, a middle school building and a theater; its high school is one hall."
"It has language exchange booths, a helipad nearby and many high-rank students, but no S faculty."
"Primary students wear heather gray waistcoats, white shirts and clip-on sapphire blue ties."
"Pocket square colors change each year; middle schoolers wear blazers."
"Fifth graders spend three weeks teleporting daily from the TC to sites around Earth."
"Middle school teaches the Contract, System theory and superhuman history, with no literature."
"Eighth graders receive a titanium logogram pin meaning 'an ending and a beginning' at once."
"Students must leave once selected; unselected students leave in ninth or tenth grade."
"Its eleventh grade is an accelerated six-day-a-week year straight into university."
"Lute Velra, Haoyu, Vandy, Kon, Lexi, Tuyet and Everly all went to Paragon."
"Nilama Middle School is a few blocks away."
"Paragon Academy was destroyed in the Matadero flood."
